<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>DYNORA Parfüm</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: "Georgia", serif;
      background: #050505;
      color: #f5f1e8;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    header {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 30px 60px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 22px;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      color: #d6b46a;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #f5f1e8;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 35px;
      font-size: 14px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: #d6b46a;
    }

    .hero {
      height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.55), rgba(0,0,0,0.85)),
        radial-gradient(circle at center, #1d1a14 0%, #050505 65%);
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 900px;
    }

    .small-title {
      color: #d6b46a;
      letter-spacing: 5px;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 82px;
      letter-spacing: 10px;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 300;
      letter-spacing: 6px;
      color: #d6b46a;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    p {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #ddd6c7;
      max-width: 620px;
      margin: 0 auto 45px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 16px 42px;
      border: 1px solid #d6b46a;
      color: #d6b46a;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      font-size: 13px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transition: 0.3s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background: #d6b46a;
      color: #050505;
    }

    .luxury-line {
      width: 90px;
      height: 1px;
      background: #d6b46a;
      margin: 0 auto 35px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      header {
        padding: 25px;
      }

      nav {
        display: none;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 48px;
        letter-spacing: 6px;
      }

      h2 {
        font-size: 20px;
      }

      p {
        font-size: 15px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <div class="logo">DYNORA</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#">Home</a>
      <a href="#">Düfte</a>
      <a href="#">Über uns</a>
      <a href="#">Kontakt</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="small-title">Mediterranean Luxury Fragrance</div>
      <h1>DYNORA</h1>
      <h2>PARFÜM</h2>
      <div class="luxury-line"></div>
      <p>
        Ein Duft inspiriert vom Mittelmeer, von warmen Küsten,
        eleganten Nächten und der zeitlosen Schönheit Süditaliens.
        DYNORA steht für Luxus, Charakter und mediterrane Eleganz.
      </p>
      <a href="#" class="btn">Kollektion entdecken</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</body>
</html>
